        "highlighted": "PostgreSQL 15–19\n       ↓\nData / COPY / Replication / pgoutput\n       ↓\nBlueTusk Streams ─→ PostgreSQL durable relay\n       ├──────────→ BlueTusk Sync\n       └──────────→ BlueTusk Live ─→ Continuous Graph\n                              ↑\n                    Control Plane / Dashboard\n",
