        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>The one-cycle smoke validates isolated checkout, restore/build, orchestration,\nartifact integrity, cleanup, and report production. It is not 24-hour release\nevidence.</p>\n<p>Validate its report with the same reader:</p>\n"
